WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:04.404
JESSE HOLMES (VOICEOVER):
Nothing's going to stop me.

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:06.740
Snow, wind, 40 below--

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.241
things like that don't stop me.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:11.778
[music playing]

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:21.788
Couldn't be any better
time to finish this up.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.556
The dogs are all resting well.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:25.558
Now it's time to keep after it.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.560
I don't want to leave
this undone and wait.

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:30.864
Because this is just going
to accumulate. , Here, Rosie.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.900
You play with your pig, and
I'll take care of the window.

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:36.302
OK?

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.004
NARRATOR: Jesse
Holmes has nearly

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:41.274
completed the new addition
to his home in Brushkana.

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:42.942
But with winter
already descending

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:46.479
on the landscape and his new
bedroom still incomplete,

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:49.115
Jesse will need to work
through the bitter cold night

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:52.318
if he's to be shielded
from the coming storm.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:53.753
JESSE HOLMES: All
right, one more

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.855
step to make this a room here.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:59.959
Get this window out, and looks
like I can wiggle it out right

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:02.662
here and keep it from breaking.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.664
There's a big sense
of vulnerability

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:05.899
moving this window.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.767
I've been able to do a
lot in the last couple

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:09.169
of weeks since my surgery.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.603
But I'm still really weak.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:15.208
And having to move this window
is the crux of this whole deal.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:16.109
There it goes.

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:18.578
There it goes.

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:20.146
Nice and easy.

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:21.047
OK.

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:23.750
Now it's time for the big lift.

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:27.587
I've been struggling for five
weeks to get strong again.

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:30.256
And I'm still 80%.

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:32.959
And this window is 100% job.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:34.294
You get one chance.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:37.163
You drop it, it
breaks, I don't have

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.166
another window to put in here.

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.968
Oh, man.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:44.704
I am having a hard time here.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.072
[sighs]

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:47.607
Just ain't as strong as I was.

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:55.215
There it goes.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:03.122
[banging]

00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:07.627
[drilling]

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:13.466
All right.

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:16.636
That's the final screw
locking it down, here.

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:20.540
Take a look at it
and let it soak in.

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:22.842
I'm exhausted from
a long day of work.

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:26.279
But I'm glad that I
committed, cut the window out,

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:27.146
got it in there.

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.281
That's a big step.

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:31.317
Now everything is just
making things aesthetic.

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.086
Rosie, come.

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:34.020
Get your limelight.

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:35.622
Come, come.

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:36.890
Hey, come and check it out.

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:38.758
Look, we got a new bedroom.

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:41.294
Yeah, look at all that new
room for you to terrorize in.

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:42.195
Huh?

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:43.563
Yeah.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.531
Do you like it?

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:52.505
To me, having this home here
is a symbol of never giving up.

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:53.973
Through these last
couple of years,

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.675
I've been to the breaking
point to where I didn't

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:57.010
think I could take it anymore.

00:02:57.076 --> 00:03:00.680
And then I keep going and
block it out of my mind,

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:02.882
keep focused.

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:06.519
Eventually, you just become
as hard as the surroundings.

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:07.654
It doesn't kill you.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.990
And then it tempers you
and makes you stronger.

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:12.725
I didn't just move out
here to train dogs.

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:14.561
I moved out here to
become a better man.

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:18.731
And every day this landscape
molds you into that.

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:22.101
Anywhere around here, I feel
a sense of satisfaction.

00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:24.070
This is a place with a
lot of future for me.

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:31.377
It's hard not to get emotional.

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:36.816
This is something that I have
wanted for myself for so long.

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:38.551
And I don't even know
what to do with it.

00:03:38.618 --> 00:03:41.354
And I'm just going to let
it play out from here.

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:45.625
But I see really good things
happening in the future.

00:03:49.228 --> 00:03:52.565
[music playing]

